  "details": "When I put physbones on the GameObject with the Constarint, the PhysBone doesn't work well.\n\nThe behaviour on OB is like with IsAnimated = false but IsAnimated = true on that avatar & it works on live 1282.\n\nThis is significant problem for Japanese traditional clothes, Wahuku. \n\nI'm playing VRChat with avatars with wahuku for most time so This is significant problem.\n\nTest video: https://youtu.be/Kg2psd5BJ6o",
